From 8fd0ff52c55bd469868e2571fbe0bb7411731d07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CompuLab <dev@compulab.co.il>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] compulab: dts: Set Edge-AI platform identity

The NVIDIA reference DTBs identify the carrier as an Engineering Reference
Developer Kit.  Override the root model for every supported Edge-AI module and
add a carrier-specific compatible string while retaining NVIDIA's identifiers
for existing platform and driver matching.

Apply the identity to both normal and Super DTBs because either variant can be
selected by the bootloader or included in an update capsule.

Signed-off-by: CompuLab <dev@compulab.co.il>
---
 .../tegra234-p3768-0000+p3767-0000-nv-super.dts   | 4 ++--
 .../nv-platform/tegra234-p3768-0000+p3767-0000-nv.dts | 5 +++++
